flowchart TB
    WEB[Web and Windows UI] -->|Authenticated requests| API[Supabase handoff API]
    FORM[Google Forms and Sheets] --> IMPORT[Existing signed Apps Script import]
    subgraph CORE[Existing workflow and provider boundary]
        API --> RULES[Canonical permission revision and lease transactions]
        IMPORT --> RULES
        RULES --> DB[(Requests reviews approvals and approved briefs)]
        ADAPTER[Shared Gemini adapter with schema and evidence validation]
        ADAPTER <--> MODEL[Gemini API]
        ADAPTER -->|Validated source-linked results| RULES
    end
    subgraph TASKS[Durable automation tasks]
        RULES --> JOBS[(Versioned tasks and assistance results)]
        CRON[Supabase Cron and pg_net check due work] -->|HMAC timestamp and nonce| WORKER[Edge worker with bounded task leases]
        VAULT[Vault and separate Edge signing secret] --> CRON
        API -->|Foreground or background dispatch| WORKER
        WORKER <--> JOBS
        WORKER -->|Reuse provider execution| ADAPTER
        WORKER -->|Permission and version checks| RULES
        JOBS --> READ[Authorized app reads and in-app task status]
    end
    DB -->|Stored approved artifacts only| EXPORT[Existing Workspace bridge and Apps Script export]
    EXPORT --> DOCS[Private Google Docs]
    DB --> PREVIEW[Exact approved ticket preview and destination]
    WEB -->|Author or assigned lead confirms| PREVIEW
    PREVIEW --> OUTBOX[(Persisted payload hash and issue UUID)]
    OUTBOX -->|Recheck source access and destination| LINEAR[Linear GraphQL API]
    LINEAR -->|Reconcile existing UUID on retry| OUTBOX
